00:58:25.080 --> 00:58:31.970
<v Sarah Vowell>Booking guests whose near constant profanity makes the show into an unintelligible barrage of bleeps.
<v Sarah Vowell>预订那些几乎不断使用亵渎语言的嘉宾，使节目变成一连串难以理解的哔哔声。

00:58:31.970 --> 00:58:54.630
